      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Saint Petersburg, Florida earns the nickname 'The Sunshine City' after recording 361 sunny days a year and holding Guinness record for 768 consecutive sunny days from 1967 to 1969.",
